---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
---

<Site
  title="A small crew in your corner"
  description="Little Fight NYC is a hands-on technology firm for independent businesses. Custom websites, practical tech support and software you own. Consulting is free."
>
  <div class="about-hero shell">
    <section class="page-head">
      <p class="label">Meet Little Fight NYC</p>
      <h1>
        SMALL CREW.
        <br />
        HEAVY PULL.
      </h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Small businesses have enough to fight. Their technology should not be
        one of them.
      </p>
    </section>
    <div class="about-mark">
      <img
        src="/brand/mark-white.svg"
        width="180"
        height="121"
        alt="The Little Fight NYC tugboat mark."
      />
      <p>
        A LITTLE CRAFT.
        <br />A LOT OF PULL.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="content-split section shell about-copy">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Serious help for small business</p>
      <h2>
        BUILT AROUND
        <br />
        YOUR DAY.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        We’re a small, hands-on NYC technology firm for owner-operated
        businesses. We build websites, fix the tools that keep the day moving,
        and create focused software when the usual options stop fitting.
      </p>
      <p>
        We start by listening. A useful first conversation can save you from
        replacing something that still works or buying another tool you do not
        need.
      </p>
      <p>
        The tugboat is our mark for a reason: a small craft can do a big job.
        Our job is to help your business move.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-split section shell">
    <div>
      <p class="label">What stays with you</p>
      <h2>
        YOU KEEP
        <br />
        THE KEYS.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Your website code, domain and hosting.</li>
      <li>Your business data and account access.</li>
      <li>Written instructions and a clear handoff.</li>
      <li>A paid scope you approve before work begins.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <ContactBand heading="Start with the business you have." />
</Site>
